# Dying as a VR player: the eyes show a still, dark space with the game's death camera on a screen ahead, and the respawn
# screen follows, the menu in front of that screen. The harness makes the death, which is only how the test gets there.
# Needs: Earth Planet (survival, on foot).
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2

# before: alive, and the eyes show the world
read character
expect state == standing
expect health >= 1
headset alive.png
expect headset bright
expect no log Forced view: on

# the character dies
die
expect applied == true
read character
expect state == dead within 5
expect log Forced view: on (the character is dead) within 10

# the eyes no longer show the world: the screen with the death camera stands ahead
wait 2
headset dead.png
expect headset changed

# the respawn screen opens, and the screen with the death camera stands behind it
read respawn
expect screenPresent == true within 40
expect log Forced view: screen put behind the menu within 5
